---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Success stories" description="See how Nobrim's methodology generates operational improvements and measurable results." lang="en">
  <section class="py-20"><div class="container narrow"><div class="text-center mb-12"><h1>Transformation stories</h1><p class="subtitle">Real-world projects and the impact generated for our clients.</p></div><article class="card"><p class="tag">Operations and logistics</p><h2>Agro Logística Sul</h2><p><strong>Challenge:</strong> limited visibility across fleet operations, long transfer queues and high freight costs.</p><p><strong>Result:</strong> 22% reduction in transit time, 18% savings in total logistics costs and 98% delivery predictability.</p><a class="btn-primary" href="/en/contact">Discuss a similar challenge</a></article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.py-20{padding:80px 0}.narrow{max-width:900px;margin-inline:auto}.text-center{text-align:center}.mb-12{margin-bottom:48px}.subtitle{font-size:1.125rem;color:var(--text-secondary);max-width:672px;margin:16px auto 0 auto;text-align:center}.tag{color:var(--accent-primary);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}</style>
